{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05114","headline":"九真山净居寺谒无碍上人 · 沈佺期","name":"九真山净居寺谒无碍上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大士生天竺，分身化日南。\n人中出烦恼，山下即伽蓝。\n小涧香爲刹，危峰石作龛。\n候禅青鸽乳，窥讲白猿参。\n藤爱云间壁，花怜石下潭。\n泉行幽供好，林挂浴衣堪。\n弟子哀无识，医王惜未谈。\n机疑闻不二，蒙昧即朝三。\n欲究因缘理，聊宽放弃慙。\n超然虎溪夕，双树下虚岚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}